{
 "about": "Abbreviations the sentence splitter protects. 'always' keeps the dot from ending a sentence; 'before_digit' protects it only when a number follows, because 'No. 5' is an abbreviation while 'No. We disagree.' is a sentence. Matching is case-sensitive: include each case and plural that occurs.",
